// RT-61's family (0.30.2), at f64: a value carried from one iteration
// of a loop to the next that is also read inside it (stored after its
// update, compared, summed again, stored to another array, carried in
// rows) is a scan, not a reduction, and is not kept in vector lanes. Every
// operation (wrapping, plain, checked, min and max), then every other use
// with a wrapping sum; trip counts 0, 1, the vector width and one either
// side, and long. Each line: a kernel, then per trip count its result
// and a hash of the arrays it wrote. The output is rustc's.
// A float carried from one iteration to the next is never a vector
// reduction (lanes would add in another order): v0.30.1 was right here,
// and this keeps it so.
// EXPECT: add_f64: 0/0 13/2799263306152693873 88/7817591825834365913 128/18379178649863674457 200/7750171296035705068 326/7165684364493355250 4784/2106434333812299363
// EXPECT: sub_f64: 0/0 -13/15647480767556857743 -88/10629152247875185703 -128/67565423845877159 -200/10696572777673846548 -326/11281059709216196366 -4784/16340309739897252253
// EXPECT: mul_f64: 1/0 2/7525557460065626602 2/2189435995553297080 2/336848156616772818 2/4561899283227166330 2/16478401919355908322 64/5050603515016767486
// EXPECT: min_f64: 50/0 13/2799263306152693873 13/5007961934241655212 13/2189513018009023317 5/3528768797680231289 5/14873281314292534653 0/14376835801726375601
// EXPECT: max_f64: 0/0 13/2799263306152693873 75/5608893197745404574 75/700453495609175405 75/2342546116967743369 94/2491150157672270476 96/1392853750560807070
// EXPECT: before_f64: 0/0 13/0 88/2208698628088961339 128/12928554083429651891 200/4830880140207484844 326/2359228616776867820 4784/9755418452232761841
// EXPECT: old_f64: 0/0 13/0 88/2208698628088961339 128/12928554083429651891 200/4830880140207484844 326/2359228616776867820 4784/9755418452232761841
// EXPECT: other_f64: 0/0 13/4079674643364687328 88/17762198788068804517 128/92938692652350253 200/13285253109024932564 326/14558507023324428756 4784/8485484408159221167
// EXPECT: derived_f64: 0/0 13/8397789918458081619 88/5006031403793546123 128/18244047802171920139 200/4803769814397563588 326/3050309019770514134 4784/6319303001436898089
// EXPECT: excl_f64: 0/0 13/0 88/2208698628088961339 128/12928554083429651891 200/4830880140207484844 326/2359228616776867820 4784/9755418452232761841
// EXPECT: cmp_f64: 0/0 13/0 88/15778683341453386855 128/5629017385130348916 200/16964914985290321480 326/4476422229645140860 4784/8464225459837809187
